{"step_index":144,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T14:07:31Z","input_tokens":2181,"cache_read_tokens":138287,"output_tokens":1105,"content":"### Real-Time Interactive Bills & Calculations Are Now Live!\n\nThe **AUDIT IT** app now supports full **real-time reactive bill auditing and calculations**. You can test this at [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ What Was Upgraded for Real-Time Functionality\n\n#### 1. Real-Time Inputs & Instant Recalculation\n- **Live Line-Item Editing ([`AuditScorecard.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/AuditScorecard.js)):**\n  - Edit **Item Description**, **Quantity (Qty)**, **Rate (₹)**, or **Billed Amount (₹)** with instantaneous updates on every keystroke (`input` event).\n  - Preserves cursor position and input focus so typing is smooth and uninterrupted.\n- **➕ Add & ✕ Delete Line Items:**\n  - Click **\"➕ Add Line Item\"** to append new goods dynamically.\n  - Click **\"✕\"** to remove any line item; subtotal, GST, and totals recalculate immediately.\n- **🪄 Auto-Fix Bill Math:**\n  - One-click button that fixes all line items (`amount = qty * rate`), subtotal, and grand total, turning an overcharged/discrepant bill into a verified bill.\n- **Supplier Header & GSTIN Validation:**\n  - Type or change the supplier name, GSTIN, or declared grand total.\n  - Validates Indian 15-character GSTIN format in real-time. If you clear the GSTIN, it immediately flags amber, warns of blocked Input Tax Credit (ITC), and updates the tax insights.\n- **Quick GST Rate Presets:**\n  - 1-tap presets for **0% (Exempt)**, **5% (Grocery/Atta)**, **12% (Standard)**, **18% (Electrical)**, and **28% (Luxury)** or manual CGST, SGST, IGST inputs.\n- **Section 44AD Digital Ratio Slider:**\n  - Adjust the **Digital Receipts Ratio** slider (0% to 100%) to watch your **Deemed Net Profit** dynamically recalculate between **6% (digital)** and **8% (cash)** alongside estimated tax under the New Regime.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Real-Time Visual Outputs & Document Sync\n- **Live Synchronized Invoice Preview ([`InvoiceViewer.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/InvoiceViewer.js)):**\n  - As you type numbers or add items on the right, the left invoice paper, line-item grid, tax split, and totals update *in real time*.\n  - Bounding boxes dynamically switch between 🔴 **Red (Math Discrepancy)**, 🟡 **Amber (Missing/Unclear)**, and 🟢 **Green (Verified Match)**.\n  - For uploaded photos/PDFs, easily toggle between **\"📷 Original Photo\"** and **\"📄 Digitized Parcha\"**.\n- **Live WhatsApp Dispute Link:**\n  - Click **\"📲 Share on WhatsApp\"** to open WhatsApp Web or mobile app with a pre-filled, bilingual (English + Hindi) dispute message detailing the exact line errors and difference amount.\n- **Live CA Audit Slip Certificate ([`CaSlipModal.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/CaSlipModal.js)):**\n  - Click **\"📑 CA Audit Slip\"** at any time to print or download an A4 audit certificate reflecting your current inputs.\n- **\"✍️ Enter Bill Manually\" Dashboard Action ([`DashboardHero.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/DashboardHero.js)):**\n  - Shopkeepers can audit physical counter parchas from scratch without needing to upload a file.\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Try It Live\n\n1. Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) in your browser.\n2. Click **Sample 2: Math Error** (Modern Electrical Supplies) to see the ₹1,000 overcharge.\n3. In the line items table, change the **LED Bulb Billed Amount** from `₹2,900` to `₹1,900`, or click **\"🪄 Auto-Fix Bill Math\"**—watch the discrepancy drop to ₹0 and the red banner flip to green verified in real time!\n4. Move the **Digital Receipts Ratio slider** in the Tax Insights card to watch your **Deemed Net Profit** and **Estimated Tax** recalculate instantly.\n5. Click **\"📲 Share on WhatsApp\"** to test the live dispute note generator."}
